# The binary file types this repository tracks, declared by type: one extension per line.
# Every other tracked file is text, and carries no NUL byte.
# No rule here sets eol or text: the Claude plugin directory refuses an attribute that
# rewrites file contents at the root, above the plugin folder or in it. The line-ending
# rule sits in a .gitattributes in each folder the gate reads (spec 312, A-312-3).
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
